  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "108",
  "quote": "permit automatic debiting of the tenant’s or prospective tenant’s account at a financial institution, automatic charging of a credit card or any other form of automatic payment for the payment of rent.",
  "reason": "Section 108(b) explicitly prohibits a tenancy agreement from requiring a tenant to permit automatic debiting of their bank account to pay rent. Because this clause conflicts with the Act by mandating pre-authorized debit, it is void under Section 4(1)."
}

